[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2567536835","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100990#issuecomment-2567536835","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100990","id":2567536835,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ZCYDD","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-02T10:12:00Z","updated_at":"2025-01-02T10:13:09Z","body":"Haven't tested the MRP yet but I would assume the imported texture is loaded as a `CompressedTexture2D` which doesn't support the alpha channel, this should probably be documented, see the source:\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/2582793d408ade0b6ed42f913ae33e7da5fb9184/scene/resources/compressed_texture.cpp#L235-L237\n\nRelated:\n* https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/94332","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2567536835/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2567773465","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100990#issuecomment-2567773465","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100990","id":2567773465,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ZDR0Z","user":{"login":"Lielay9","id":40064911,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMDY0OTEx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/40064911?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lielay9","html_url":"https://github.com/Lielay9","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lielay9/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lielay9/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lielay9/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lielay9/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lielay9/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lielay9/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lielay9/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lielay9/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lielay9/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-02T13:26:05Z","updated_at":"2025-01-02T13:26:05Z","body":"The compressed texture does know its own format,\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/2582793d408ade0b6ed42f913ae33e7da5fb9184/scene/resources/compressed_texture.h#L66\nwhich it could use to derive whether alpha channel is present like the other texture types do:\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/2582793d408ade0b6ed42f913ae33e7da5fb9184/scene/resources/image_texture.cpp#L151-L153\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/2582793d408ade0b6ed42f913ae33e7da5fb9184/scene/resources/portable_compressed_texture.cpp#L235-L237\nNotably though, many formats that support alpha channel aren't accounted for, e.g. FORMAT_RGBA4444, FORMAT_RGBAH, FORMAT_BPTC_RGBA ...\nPerhaps there could be a unified func in image to check if format supports alpha; Would make it easier to update when new formats are added as it seems that that's needed in other places too e.g.\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/2582793d408ade0b6ed42f913ae33e7da5fb9184/core/io/image.cpp#L3404\n\nAnd, it might be worthwhile to scour other places that have limited format support e.g. Image::detect_alpha():\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/2582793d408ade0b6ed42f913ae33e7da5fb9184/core/io/image.cpp#L2503-L2522\nand either implement/document.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2567773465/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4727295177","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100990#issuecomment-4727295177","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100990","id":4727295177,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABGcTMyQ","user":{"login":"atirutw","id":25323231,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MzIzMjMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25323231?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/atirutw","html_url":"https://github.com/atirutw","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atirutw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atirutw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atirutw/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atirutw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atirutw/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atirutw/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atirutw/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atirutw/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atirutw/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-17T07:37:36Z","updated_at":"2026-06-17T07:37:36Z","body":"Hi all! Found a workaround: `texture.get_image().detect_alpha() != Image.ALPHA_NONE` will be true if alpha channel is present.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4727295177/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]